.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-MIGRATE 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-migrate \- Preview migration to a patched native D-Bus platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-migrate VMID [--apply]
.SH DESCRIPTION
This tool is for the separate patched native preview. Do not run it on a stock standalone installation. Applying a migration requires a stopped VM and matching native Proxmox packages.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
